source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: Jira autolinks the ftp URL without changing its visible text, so jiro stays silent.
-- input.jira --
{{ftp://x.y}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt><a href="ftp://x.y" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">ftp://x.y</a></tt></p>
-- want.md --
`ftp://x.y`
-- warnings.json --
[]
